        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: புள்ளிவிவரம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "புள்ளிவிவரம் — puḷḷivivaram — \"statistics\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்தப் புள்ளிவிவரங்கள் எதைக் காட்டுகின்றன? intap puḷḷivivaraṅkaḷ etaik kāṭṭukiṉṟaṉa? What do these statistics show?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Usually plural: புள்ளிவிவரங்கள்."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "புள்ளிவிவரம் (puḷḷivivaram) joins native puḷḷi, \"mark, dot\" (DEDR 4327), and vivaram, \"details\", borrowed from Sanskrit vivaraṇa, \"laying open, explanation\" (Monier-Williams): details by the point."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
