          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சதவீதம் — catavītam — \"a percentage; per cent\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "எண்பது சதவீதம் மாணவர்கள் தேர்வில் தேர்ச்சி பெற்றார்கள். eṇpatu catavītam māṇavarkaḷ tērvil tērcci peṟṟārkaḷ. Eighty per cent of the students passed the exam."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Numbers are spelled out: பத்து சதவீதம் (catavītam), ten per cent."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சதவீதம் (catavītam) joins catam, \"a hundred\", borrowed from Sanskrit śata (CDIAL 12278), and vītam, \"a rate, a share\", whose origin is not settled: so much per hundred."
            }
          ]
        },
