          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விகிதம் (vikitam) is borrowed from Sanskrit vihita, \"distributed, apportioned, fixed\" (Monier-Williams). Tamil writes the Sanskrit h between vowels as க."
