          "title": "You'll want to know: கணி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கணி — kaṇi — \"to predict; to calculate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அடுத்த ஆண்டு விலைகள் உயரும் என்று அவர்கள் கணித்தார்கள். aṭutta āṇṭu vilaikaḷ uyarum eṉṟu avarkaḷ kaṇittārkaḷ. They predicted that prices would rise next year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): கணித்தேன், kaṇittēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The prediction is a clause with என்று. கணிதம், mathematics, comes from the same Sanskrit root."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கணி (kaṇi) is a verb built on Sanskrit gaṇayati, \"counts, takes notice of\" (CDIAL 3993), the source of கணிதம், \"mathematics\". Tamil writes the Sanskrit g as க."
            }
          ]
        },
